cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Ancestry Estimation Pipeline for a Latvian Cohort"
abstract: >-
  Ancestry estimation pipeline for a Latvian cohort, built on AEon against a
  custom 224-population reference merged from the 1000 Genomes Project, a
  UK Biobank-derived 82-fine-scale-population panel (AC82), and the Allen
  Ancient DNA Resource (AADR), producing per-participant PDF ancestry
  reports in English or Latvian.
authors:
